Source: decoderbufs
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libprotobuf-c-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/debezium/postgres-decoderbufs

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-decoderbufs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Protocol Buffers logical decoding output plugin
 Decoderbufs serializes PostgreSQL logical changes as Protocol Buffers for Debezium.
